|description  = {{sbc|Active:}} '''Taliyah''' marks the target location and selects a direction. After {{tt|{{fd|0.792 seconds}}|Under normal tick interval circumstances, both cast time and 0.5s delay are rounding up}}, a ledge erupts from the area that {{tip|airborne|knocks}} enemies hit 400 units in the target direction over 1 second.
